gh then the lion is cold.** (Given).\n14.**If someone likes the lion then the lion is green.** (Given).\n15.**If someone is kind then they like the lion.** (Given).\nThe lion is green because if the lion were green, it would be eaten by the cat according to statement 14.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
