e are furry.\n   - We know that all furry people are white.\n\n5.**Conclusion:**.\n   - Since Gary is green, and all green people are smart, we can infer that Gary is smart.\n   - Since Gary is smart, and all smart people are big, we can infer that Gary is big.\n   - Since Gary is big, and all big, green people are furry, we can infer that Gary is furry.\n   - Since Gary is furry, and all furry people are white, we can infer that Gary is white\n. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
