messages:  [['Please solve the logical reasoning problem.\nGiven a context and a question, answer with the correct option: A, B or C. Please reason step by step.\n####\n# Context:\nDave is green. Dave is kind. Erin is cold. Erin is furry. Fiona is big. Fiona is furry. Gary is big. All kind people are cold. Green, smart people are rough. If Fiona is cold and Fiona is kind then Fiona is green. If someone is furry then they are smart. All furry, green people are smart. If someone is green and cold then they are big. If someone is furry and rough then they are big. All furry people are smart. Big, cold people are furry.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? Dave is not big.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown', '<think>.\nTo determine whether the statement "Dave is not big" is true, false, or unknown based on the given information, let\'s analyze the context step by step:.\n\n1.**Dave is green.**.\n2.**Dave is kind.**.\n3.**Erin is cold.**.\n4.**Erin is furry.**.\n5.**Fiona is big.**.\n6.**Fiona is furry.**.\n7.**Gary is big.**.\n8.**All kind people are cold.**.\n9.**Green, smart people are rough.**.\n10.**If Fiona is cold and Fiona is kind then Fiona is green.**.\n11.**If someone is furry then they are smart.**.\n12.**All furry, green people are smart.**.\n13.**If someone is green and cold then they are big.**.\n14.**If someone is furry and rough then they are big.**.\nDave is big.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
