ing the rabbit:**.\n   - If the squirrel is chasing the rabbit, it must be visible to the rabbit at some point during the chase.\n   - However, the statement explicitly says that the rabbit does not see the squirrel.\n\n4.**Conclusion:**.Given that the rabbit does not see the squirrel, it is consistent with the information provided that the squirrel does see the rabbit. Therefore, the statement "The squirrel does not see the rabbit" is false based on the given context.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
