is furry.**.\n   - This statement does not directly relate to Bob\'s greenness, so it doesn\'t help us determine if Bob is green.\n\n7.**Green people are furry.**.\nBased on the given information, there is direct and indirect evidence that suggests Bob is green. Therefore, the statement "Bob is green" is true.. Therefore, my final option is: ']]
